[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4298394647","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118855#issuecomment-4298394647","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118855","id":4298394647,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABADRMFw","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-22T17:11:30Z","updated_at":"2026-04-22T17:15:55Z","body":"I prefer this form of the template.\r\n\r\nI agree that a 'what problems does this solve' is _always_ needed.\r\n\r\nThe link to the \"here's other ideas what you can add\" also makes sense to me.\r\nDepending on how bad it gets with AI, we could expand the AI thing into its own section, but a quick comment above is a decent start.\r\n\r\nI think i'd be OK with merging this, but we need more discussion / eyes on it first.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4298394647/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4298493221","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118855#issuecomment-4298493221","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118855","id":4298493221,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABADXNJQ","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-22T17:18:26Z","updated_at":"2026-04-22T17:18:26Z","body":"> Personally, I have fallen into this trap: because it is a checklist for \"new\" contributors, I haven't read it for years because I assumed it was just about setting up local style checks and that sort of thing. But it's not: it also includes other important reminders that all contributors should act on.\r\n\r\nBy the way, it hasn't existed for years :) it was just added a few months ago, partially to have a place to put the \"please disclose AI\" phrase. \r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4298493221/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4298617984","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118855#issuecomment-4298617984","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118855","id":4298617984,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABADe0gA","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-22T17:34:28Z","updated_at":"2026-04-22T17:34:28Z","body":"Hah! Well, I hadn’t read the rest of the contributing guidelines for years, so I just assumed this list was a part of what did exist and glossed over it for the last few months thinking it was just for new contributors.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4298617984/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":2,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4299226374","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118855#issuecomment-4299226374","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118855","id":4299226374,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAED9Bg","user":{"login":"charjr","id":102669158,"node_id":"U_kgDOBh6bZg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102669158?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charjr","html_url":"https://github.com/charjr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charjr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charjr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charjr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charjr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charjr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charjr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charjr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charjr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charjr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-22T19:11:46Z","updated_at":"2026-04-22T19:11:46Z","body":"Regardless of whether more is needed, I think this would be an improvement to the existing template. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4299226374/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4389911339","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118855#issuecomment-4389911339","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118855","id":4389911339,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBai7Kw","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-06T16:05:21Z","updated_at":"2026-05-06T16:05:21Z","body":"> Status: Needs More Reviews\r\n\r\n> Ivorius: Needs 2 or 3 endorsements\r\n\r\nI’m by no means in a rush to get this merged or reluctant to have more people look at a PR before it’s merged… but I can’t help but comment that it is a bit silly that a PR like this requires more scrutiny, review, and attention than most other PRs that directly affect the behaviour of all games and apps made with the Godot engine. To be honest, the real point to be made here is that maybe we should scrutinize and have more people looking at PRs that are a part of the Godot engine code to match this level of care, but we all know that’s, unfortunately, unrealistic.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4389911339/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4389960688","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118855#issuecomment-4389960688","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118855","id":4389960688,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBal78A","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-06T16:11:27Z","updated_at":"2026-05-06T16:11:59Z","body":"> > Status: Needs More Reviews\r\n> \r\n> > Ivorius: Needs 2 or 3 endorsements\r\n> \r\n> I’m by no means in a rush to get this merged or reluctant to have more people look at a PR before it’s merged… but I can’t help but comment that it is a bit silly that a PR like this requires more scrutiny, review, and attention than most other PRs that directly affect the behaviour of all games and apps made with the Godot engine. To be honest, the real point to be made here is that maybe we should scrutinize and have more people looking at PRs that are a part of the Godot engine code to match this level of care, but we all know that’s, unfortunately, unrealistic.\r\n\r\nIt's a workflow change that affects all contributors, and maintainers especially since they work with the codebase every day. I'd have expected more people to have an opinion, and that it wouldn't be difficult to get a few more people to share their thoughts, but apparently not so :D \r\n\r\nLet's wait for until end of week; if nobody else chimes in I think we can just go ahead with this.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4389960688/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4390037916","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118855#issuecomment-4390037916","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118855","id":4390037916,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBaqpnA","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-06T16:22:48Z","updated_at":"2026-05-06T16:22:48Z","body":"Sounds good. Having a timeframe instead of a required number of approvals is a more reasonable approach for this sort of a PR.\r\n\r\nAlso, the Godot policy on GitHub is to discourage people from posting comments that say they agree with a PR because it adds nothing to the conversation. Instead, they are encouraged to give a 👍. This means that when there is silence and 👍, there have actually been as many opinions voiced as there are 👍. So I’d say there have been quite a few thoughts shared in this case. (14 currently)\r\n\r\nBut, yes, very few disagreements with the sentiment and implementation details, likely because most of those were voiced in the previous PR that this one supersedes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4390037916/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4390471600","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118855#issuecomment-4390471600","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118855","id":4390471600,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBbFHsA","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-06T17:29:13Z","updated_at":"2026-05-06T17:29:13Z","body":"It seems I can't post review comments since today (GitHub issue?). What I wanted to point out in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118855#pullrequestreview-4238204934 is that we should use `###` for headings instead of `##` to be consistent with issues created with the bug report template.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4390471600/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4390517333","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118855#issuecomment-4390517333","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118855","id":4390517333,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBbH6VQ","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-06T17:36:20Z","updated_at":"2026-05-06T17:36:20Z","body":"> It seems I can't post review comments since today (GitHub issue?). What I wanted to point out in [#118855 (review)](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118855#pullrequestreview-4238204934) is that we should use `###` for headings instead of `##` to be consistent with issues created with the bug report template.\r\n\r\nThat was Allen's initial design, but I asked to use `##` because (imo) the lines make it easier to read, especially when people add their own subsections. \r\nThe issue template is less likely to get custom subsections because it's a more streamlined process.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4390517333/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4390696213","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118855#issuecomment-4390696213","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118855","id":4390696213,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBbS1FQ","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-06T18:04:12Z","updated_at":"2026-05-06T18:04:12Z","body":"> I like the \"- Closes\" line, but I also wonder if people will just link an Issue to close, and that Issue has barely any information and/or barely any (if at all) discussion. Maybe I'm just misunderstanding how this will be formatted, but I think it'd probably be better if \"What problem(s) does this PR solve?\" and \"Issues/proposals closed by this PR\" were made more distinct, if possible...\r\n> \r\n> (making a general comment because I'm getting an internal error and can't comment on the line)\r\n\r\nI originally had instructions for how to fill this section out that I shared in the “discussion” section of this PR’s description text, but it ended up being too much text for a template like this. I also had more headings in my first draft that this PR supersedes…\r\n\r\nSo… I’m not sure how to improve this overall in a way that better communicates this. If a PR author feels a linked issue doesn’t fully describe the problem, then I expect they’ll write more here. And if they don’t, I expect they probably wouldn’t write more even if prompted… hmm.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4390696213/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4390904949","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118855#issuecomment-4390904949","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118855","id":4390904949,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBbfkdQ","user":{"login":"Akosmo","id":95504962,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbFKQg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95504962?v=4","gravatar_id":"","u